    Becoming.SelectionLevels.concordAmong gs w a = 0 ∧ Becoming.SelectionLevels.discordAmong gs w a = 0
@Becoming.SelectionLevels.levels_of_alike : ∀ {α : Type} (gs : List (List α)) (w a : α → Nat) {m c : Nat},
