              Becoming.SelectionLevels.concordAmong gs (G.offspringNumber t) (G.amount t))
@Becoming.SelectionLevels.rises_exact_iff_sized : ∀ {α : Type} (G : Becoming.SelectionTerm.Generations α) {t n : Nat}
